#: ../../BaTiO3/stability.rst:619
msgid "DFT と MLIP の比較"
msgstr "Comparison of DFT and MLIP"

#: ../../BaTiO3/stability.rst:621
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"DFT 計算では、OpenMX-DFT と QE-DFT のいずれも\\ :math:`R < O < T < C` の順序を与えました"
"。OpenMX-DFT では\\ :math:`O-R = 0.136~\\mathrm{meV/f.u.}` "
"と非常に小さく、菱面体晶相と斜方晶相は\\ ほぼ縮退しています。一方、QE-DFT では :math:`O-R = "
"2.469~\\mathrm{meV/f.u.}`、\\ :math:`T-R = "
"10.041~\\mathrm{meV/f.u.}`、:math:`C-R = 45.608~\\mathrm{meV/f.u.}`\\ "
"であり、相の対称性が高くなるにつれて相対エネルギーが段階的に上昇します。\\ これは、0 K "
"の静的エネルギー曲面において、強誘電歪みをもつ低対称相が、\\ 非分極の立方晶相より安定化されることを示しています。"
msgstr ""
"Both OpenMX-DFT and QE-DFT gave the order \\  :math:`R < O < T < C`. The "
"energy difference in OpenMX-DFT was only \\  :math:`O-R = "
"0.136~\\mathrm{meV/f.u.}`, so the rhombohedral and orthorhombic phases \\"
"  were nearly degenerate. By contrast, QE-DFT gave :math:`O-R = "
"2.469~\\mathrm{meV/f.u.}`, \\  :math:`T-R = 10.041~\\mathrm{meV/f.u.}`, "
"and :math:`C-R = 45.608~\\mathrm{meV/f.u.}` \\  with a stepwise increase "
"in relative energy as the phase symmetry increased. \\  This shows that "
"on the 0 K static energy surface, the low-symmetry phases with \\  "
"ferroelectric distortions are more stable than the cubic phase without "
"polarization."

#: ../../BaTiO3/stability.rst:630
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"MLIP 計算でも同じ順序が得られました。SevenNet-ASE と FairChem-ASE では、\\ 斜方晶相は菱面体晶相より約 "
":math:`4~\\mathrm{meV/f.u.}` 高く、正方晶相は\\ さらに高いです。CHGNet-LAMMPS では "
":math:`O-R = 0.763~\\mathrm{meV/f.u.}` と\\ 小さい一方、立方晶相は "
":math:`64.320~\\mathrm{meV/f.u.}` 高く評価されました。\\ MLIP "
"の種類によってエネルギー差の大きさは異なりますが、基底状態の相安定性順序は\\ DFT と一致しています。このことは、MLIP "
"を用いた構造最適化でも、BaTiO₃ の代表的な\\ 多形間の相対安定性を定性的に再現できることを示しています。"
msgstr ""
"The MLIP calculations gave the same order. With SevenNet-ASE and "
"FairChem-ASE, \\  the orthorhombic phase was about "
":math:`4~\\mathrm{meV/f.u.}` above the rhombohedral phase, and the "
"tetragonal phase \\  was higher still. CHGNet-LAMMPS gave a small "
"rhombohedral–orthorhombic difference of :math:`O-R = "
"0.763~\\mathrm{meV/f.u.}`, but \\  the same calculation placed the cubic "
"phase :math:`64.320~\\mathrm{meV/f.u.}` above the rhombohedral phase. \\"
"  Although the size of the energy differences varies among MLIPs, \\  the"
" ground-state phase ordering agrees with DFT. This shows that geometry "
"optimization with MLIPs can \\  qualitatively reproduce the relative "
"stability of representative BaTiO₃ polymorphs."

#: ../../BaTiO3/stability.rst:638
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"ただし、:math:`R` と :math:`O` のエネルギー差は、OpenMX-DFT と\\ CHGNet-LAMMPS では 1 "
":math:`\\mathrm{meV/f.u.}` 以下であり、数値収束、格子拘束、\\ "
"原子位置最適化の条件に対して敏感です。このため、これら二つの相の順位を\\ 議論する場合には、k "
"点密度、カットオフ、最終構造の分極方向、力の収束条件を\\ 明記する必要があります。一方で、全手法に共通して立方晶相が最も高いエネルギーを\\ "
"示す点は明確であり、非分極立方晶相が 0 K の基底状態ではないことをよく表しています。"
msgstr ""
"However, the energy difference between :math:`R` and :math:`O` in OpenMX-"
"DFT and \\  CHGNet-LAMMPS is at most 1 :math:`\\mathrm{meV/f.u.}` and is "
"sensitive to numerical convergence, lattice constraints, \\  and the "
"settings for atomic position optimization. When discussing the order of "
"these two phases, \\  the k-point density, cutoff, polarization direction"
" of the final structure, and force convergence criteria \\  must "
"therefore be stated. By contrast, every method clearly gives the highest "
"energy to the cubic phase, \\  showing that the nonpolar cubic phase is "
"not the ground state at 0 K."

#: ../../BaTiO3/stability.rst:646
msgid "物理的な解釈"
msgstr "Physical Interpretation"

#: ../../BaTiO3/stability.rst:648
msgid ""
"BaTiO₃ の相安定性は、Ti 原子のオフセンター変位と O 八面体の応答による\\ `極性ソフトモード <https://technical-"
"notes.quemix.com/solid/soft_mode.html#polar-soft-mode>`__\\ "
"と、格子歪みとの結合に強く支配されます。\\ 各相の分極の向き（:math:`T` は :math:`\\langle "
"100\\rangle`、:math:`O` は :math:`\\langle 110\\rangle`、\\ :math:`R` は "
":math:`\\langle 111\\rangle`）は、:math:`a`、:math:`b`、:math:`c` "
"と格子角の歪みと結びついています。\\ この関係は、分域（ドメイン）構造や巨視的応答を議論する上でも重要です :sup:`[1]`\\ "
"（技術ノートの\\ `分域と分域壁 <https://technical-"
"notes.quemix.com/solid/ferroelectricity.html#ferroelectric-domains>`__）。"
msgstr ""
"Phase stability in BaTiO₃ depends strongly on how the \\  `polar soft "
"mode <https://technical-notes.quemix.com/solid/soft_mode.html#polar-soft-"
"mode>`__ \\  arising from off-center Ti displacements and the response of"
" the oxygen octahedra couples to lattice strain. \\  The polarization "
"directions (:math:`T` along :math:`\\langle 100\\rangle`, :math:`O` along"
" :math:`\\langle 110\\rangle`, and \\  :math:`R` along :math:`\\langle "
"111\\rangle`) are coupled to distortions in :math:`a`, :math:`b`, "
":math:`c`, and the lattice angles. \\  This relationship also matters "
"when discussing domain structure and macroscopic response :sup:`[1]` \\  "
"(see the Technical Notes on \\  `domains and domain walls <https"
"://technical-notes.quemix.com/solid/ferroelectricity.html#ferroelectric-"
"domains>`__)."

#: ../../BaTiO3/stability.rst:654
msgid ""
"Senn らの局所構造解析によれば、Ti の局所的なオフセンター変位はどの相でも菱面体的で、\\ "
"相の違いは変位の相関の向きと格子歪みの組み合わせに現れます :sup:`[6]`\\ （技術ノートの\\ `局所的なTiの変位と平均構造 "
"<https://technical-notes.quemix.com/solid/ferroelectricity.html#fe-local-"
"average>`__）。\\ したがって、本計算で各相の分極方向と格子の特徴を保ちながら最適化した\\ ことは、相安定性を比較する上で重要です。"
msgstr ""
"According to the local structure analysis by Senn et al., the local off-"
"center Ti displacements are rhombohedral in character in every phase. \\"
"  The phases differ in how the direction of displacement correlations "
"combines with lattice strain :sup:`[6]` \\  (see the Technical Notes on "
"\\  `local Ti displacements and average structure <https://technical-"
"notes.quemix.com/solid/ferroelectricity.html#fe-local-average>`__). \\  "
"Preserving the polarization direction and lattice characteristics of each"
" phase during \\  optimization was therefore important for comparing "
"their stability."

#: ../../BaTiO3/stability.rst:659
msgid ""
"また、Nishimatsu らは、BaTiO₃ の相転移温度や分極歪みが、DFT の\\ `交換相関汎関数 <https://technical-"
"notes.quemix.com/electronic/exchange_correlation.html#exchange-"
"correlation-functional>`__\\ と\\ 格子定数に強く依存することを示しています "
":sup:`[7]`。本結果でも、手法によって\\ 相対エネルギーの大きさは異なります。しかし、DFT と MLIP の両方で同じ\\ "
":math:`R < O < T < C` の順序が得られたことは、今回の構造最適化手順が\\ BaTiO₃ の 0 K "
"相安定性を捉える上で妥当であることを支持しています。"
msgstr ""
"Nishimatsu et al. also showed that the phase transition temperatures and "
"distortions associated with polarization in BaTiO₃ depend strongly on the"
" DFT \\  `exchange-correlation functional <https://technical-"
"notes.quemix.com/electronic/exchange_correlation.html#exchange-"
"correlation-functional>`__ \\  and \\  the lattice constants :sup:`[7]`. "
"In our results, too, the relative energies \\  differ in magnitude among "
"methods. However, DFT and MLIPs gave the same order \\  :math:`R < O < T "
"< C`, which supports the use of this geometry optimization procedure to "
"\\  capture the 0 K phase stability of BaTiO₃."

#: ../../BaTiO3/stability.rst:667
msgid "結論と今後の展望"
msgstr "Conclusions and Outlook"

#: ../../BaTiO3/stability.rst:669
msgid ""
"本計算では、OpenMX-DFT、QE-DFT、SevenNet-ASE、FairChem-ASE、CHGNet-LAMMPS の\\ "
"すべてにおいて、BaTiO₃ の 0 K 安定性順序として"
msgstr ""
"OpenMX-DFT, QE-DFT, SevenNet-ASE, FairChem-ASE, and CHGNet-LAMMPS \\  all"
" gave the following stability order for BaTiO₃ at 0 K:"

#: ../../BaTiO3/stability.rst:672
msgid "R < O < T < C"
msgstr "R < O < T < C"

#: ../../BaTiO3/stability.rst:676
msgid ""
"が得られました。この結果は、低温で菱面体晶相が最安定となり、温度上昇に伴って\\ "
"斜方晶相、正方晶相、立方晶相へ移るという実験的な相転移系列と整合します。\\ また、DFT だけでなく MLIP "
"でも同じ相安定性順序を再現できることから、\\ MLIP は BaTiO₃ の構造探索や有限温度シミュレーションの初期評価に有用であると\\ "
"考えられます。"
msgstr ""
"This result is consistent with the experimental phase transition "
"sequence, in which the rhombohedral phase is the most stable at low "
"temperatures \\  and the orthorhombic, tetragonal, and cubic phases "
"appear in succession as the temperature rises. \\  Both DFT and MLIPs "
"reproduced this phase ordering, \\  suggesting that MLIPs could be useful"
" for exploring BaTiO₃ structures \\  and for preliminary evaluations in "
"finite-temperature simulations."

#: ../../BaTiO3/stability.rst:682
msgid ""
"一方で、0 K の静的エネルギー順位だけでは、相転移温度や有限温度での安定性は決まりません。\\ 残る課題は、(i) "
"フォノンによる動的安定性の確認、(ii) 分子動力学またはモンテカルロ法による\\ 有限温度効果の評価、(iii) "
"自由エネルギー、エントロピー、熱膨張を含む相境界の解析です\\ （技術ノートの\\ `虚数振動数と動的安定性 <https"
"://technical-notes.quemix.com/solid/phonon.html#imaginary-"
"frequency>`__、\\ `零点振動と零点エネルギー <https://technical-"
"notes.quemix.com/solid/phonon_thermal.html#zero-point-vibration>`__）。\\ "
"とくに菱面体晶相と斜方晶相のエネルギー差が小さいため、有限温度効果、零点振動、\\ "
"格子歪みと分極の結合が相転移挙動に大きく寄与する可能性があります。\\ この結果は、フォノン安定性、ドメイン構造、粒界構造などを調べるための 0 "
"K の基準になります。\\ 温度を上げたときに現れる相は、:doc:`構造相転移 <phase_transition>` の昇温計算で調べます。"
msgstr ""
"However, the static energy order at 0 K alone does not determine the "
"transition temperatures or stability at finite temperatures. \\  Open "
"tasks are (i) checking dynamical stability using phonons, (ii) evaluating"
" \\  finite-temperature effects using molecular dynamics or Monte Carlo "
"simulations, and (iii) analyzing phase boundaries while accounting for "
"free energy, entropy, and thermal expansion \\  (see the Technical Notes "
"on \\  `imaginary frequencies and dynamical stability <https://technical-"
"notes.quemix.com/solid/phonon.html#imaginary-frequency>`__ and \\  `zero-"
"point vibrations and zero-point energy <https://technical-"
"notes.quemix.com/solid/phonon_thermal.html#zero-point-vibration>`__). \\"
"  Because the energy difference between the rhombohedral and orthorhombic"
" phases is small, finite-temperature effects, zero-point vibrations, \\  "
"and the coupling of lattice strain to polarization could make substantial"
" contributions to the phase transition behavior. \\  These results "
"provide a 0 K reference for investigating phonon stability, domain "
"structures, and grain boundary structures, among other topics. \\  The "
"heating calculations in :doc:`Structural Phase Transitions "
"<phase_transition>` examine which phases appear as the temperature rises."

